1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
You don't need a dozen flights to see China's northwest.
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
It's one road loop — about 3,000 km.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
Start and finish in one city: Xining.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,800
Seven to ten days, mostly by road.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,200
You loop past a lake that mirrors the sky.

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,600
Hills striped like a layer cake.

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,000
Grasslands, then singing sand dunes.

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,400
Double-tap if you'd drive this instead of flying.

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,200
★ Expert Tip: come in July — Menyuan's rapeseed turns the loop gold.

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,000
Drive 3,000 km, or fly city to city? Comment.
